C.O.D., lab and Port textures
-----------------------------

Files: src/main/resources/assets/mechanicalmasteryreborn/textures/block/cod_*.png,
       src/main/resources/assets/mechanicalmasteryreborn/textures/block/lab_*.png,
       src/main/resources/assets/mechanicalmasteryreborn/textures/block/*_port_*.png
Author: Malcolm Riley
Source: https://github.com/malcolmriley/unused-textures, blocks/ at commit
        8b85ad732023174d9a9da74e6bf2272d6c0bef17
        - cod_top.png is device_terminal_top, and cod_side_shut_down.png device_terminal_front_off,
          with the beige casing darkened: each pixel brighter than 120 and of a spread under 60
          between its channels scaled by (0.55, 0.56, 0.6).
        - cod_side.png is device_terminal_front_on with the casing darkened the same way, its black
          screen lit dark green (8, 70 + its lightness, 20), its white cursor bright green
          (120, 255, 140) and its yellow lamp green (40, 210, 70).
        - lab_bottom.png is sand_obsidian, copied unmodified; lab_top.png is device_workbench_top,
          and lab_side.png glass_crystal_0, greyed to 55% and 60% of their lightness and laid over
          sand_obsidian.
        - <essence>_port_open.png is block_gem_sapphire recoloured to the essence's colour, each
          pixel that colour scaled by 1.6 times its lightness: galvanic (137, 225, 233), warding
          (169, 176, 185), vital (101, 219, 101) and aureate (228, 184, 109).
        - <essence>_port_closed.png is industrial_metal_duct_flat_2 with its middle 6x6 pixels
          those of the open texture at 45% brightness.
        - <essence>_port_won.png is block_gem_sapphire_2 with its gem recoloured as the open one
          (only pixels of a spread over 40 between their channels) and its frame lightened by 10%.
